tpl
------------------------------------------
Small binary serialization library

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libtpl-devel-1.6.1-1bl2
  libtpl0-1.6.1-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/troydhanson/tpl

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/troydhanson/tpl/archive/refs/tags/v1.6.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack tpl-1.6.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./tpl-1.6.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/tpl-1.6.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/tpl-1.6.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtpl0-1.6.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtpl-devel-1.6.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(tpl)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/tpl.README
  /usr/share/doc/tpl/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/tpl/README

(libtpl0)
  /usr/bin/cygtpl-0.dll

(libtpl-devel)
  /usr/include/tpl.h
  /usr/lib/libtpl.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/tpl.pc

------------------

